 purpose and audience, gather verified facts, apply the Communication Planning method, check the result, and record the next action. Example: Use Communication Capstone checklist and evidence log and retain evidence of the result. Quality and interview check: Verify the outcome, explain trade-offs and avoid: Promising an unapproved recovery. Example: Explain how you would apply communication planning in this scenario: Handle a missed client deadline through escalation, update, recovery meeting and follow-up.","key_terms":[{"term":"Communication Planning","definition":"A practical capability used in communication capstone work.","example":"Handle a missed client deadline through escalation, update, recovery meeting and follow-up."},{"term":"Professional Judgement","definition":"A practical capability used in communication capstone work.","example":"Handle a missed client deadline through escalation, update, recovery meeting and follow-up."}]},"principles":{"rules":[{"rule_number":1,"title":"Principle","explanation":"Integrated communication uses the right channel, accurate evidence and a controlled next action.","why_it_works":"Example: Handle a missed client deadline through escalation, update, recovery meeting and follow-up.","exception":null},{"rule_number":2,"title":"Workplace method","explanation":"Define the purpose and audience, gather verified facts, apply the Communication Planning method, check the result, and record the next action.","why_it_works":"Example: Use Communication Capstone checklist and evidence log and retain evidence of the result.","exception":null},{"rule_number":3,"title":"Quality and interview check","explanation":"Verify the outcome, explain trade-offs and avoid: Promising an unapproved recovery.","why_it_works":"Example: Explain how you would apply communication planning in this scenario: Handle a missed client deadline through escalation, update, recovery meeting and follow-up.","exception":null}],"important_distinctions":[]},"applicat